  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_01",
      "hash64": "07B49E6934A10756",
      "text": "奇樹奇述直播的各位看官！\\n早午晚安哈囉Ciao！是我奇樹喔！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_02",
      "hash64": "07B49D6934A105A3",
      "text": "今天的來賓是熱騰騰剛出爐的新冠軍，\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_03",
      "hash64": "07B49C6934A103F0",
      "text": "我說[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在館主圈裡\\n也是個爆紅的話題焦點喔～？[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_04",
      "hash64": "07B4A36934A10FD5",
      "text": "現在一想，看到[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在道館測驗的表現時，\\n我就已經感到超級酥麻酥麻的了～[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_05",
      "hash64": "07B4A26934A10E22",
      "text": "這次的直播到底會爆紅到什麼程度呢？\\n我已經開始期待看到數字囉～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_06",
      "hash64": "07B4A16934A10C6F",
      "text": "那奇好～直播的鏡頭\\n就拉到差不多這麼遠……[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_07",
      "hash64": "07B4A06934A10ABC",
      "text": "各位看官，讓大家久等了！\\n差不多要開始對戰囉！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_08",
      "hash64": "07B4A76934A116A1",
      "text": "道館館主奇樹我！\\n要拿出難得一見的真本事了！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_09",
      "hash64": "07B4A66934A114EE",
      "text": "唉呀呀，雖然打輸了對戰\\n是會讓我覺得不甘心啦，但是……？[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_10",
      "hash64": "07B11969349DEF80",
      "text": "這次的奇樹奇述直播\\n觀眾數一路飆升！\\r\\n啊啊～太幸福了！我都要升天啦～！！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_11",
      "hash64": "07B11A69349DF133",
      "text": "果然當紅人物的\\n吸睛度就是不一樣～！！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_12",
      "hash64": "07B11B69349DF2E6",
      "text": "以後也要和我定期合作喔！還有，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳可別去上其他直播主的節目喔！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_13",
      "hash64": "07B11C69349DF499",
      "text": "那奇好～代我向首席問好！\\n報告時要幫我包裝一下喔～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_134",
      "hash64": "AFE7F3C46866C1F7",
      "text": "吸睛電網捕捉你的眼睛！\\n以上是誰在奇述？是我奇樹為您播放～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
